  "proof": {
    "actual_value": "Direct circleNorm_inverseCompose_family_growth at zero travel on the joint indexed low-box (parameter,source). Choose b=max(b0,ell+2), lossV=b+ell+2 once. Sum only finitely many constants j<=s and use grading monotonicity; no base increase with s.",
    "continuous_source": "The same P0 is bundled by inverseFamilyContinuousLinearMap using the given genuine JP0 continuity on the positive domain. ContinuousMultilinearMap.ofSubsingleton and current185 multilinear_bound_of_unitBall normalize only source, including seminorm-zero cases.",
    "common_domain": "For fixed a>0 set c=min(a,1)/2 and t=1-c>0. U is the preimage of the existing positiveLiftDomain under e↦t^-1•e. The true decoder derivative commutes with scalar multiplication. Thus U is open, has a common derivative lower c, lies in the positive domain, and contains every point with derivative >=a. No old UniformGrowth/Family160 helper is imported.",
    "same_maps": "The same P0 equals the original fixed-lower inverse on U by decoder injectivity, and true left/right inverse lemmas apply to the actual zero-travel L. The CLM wrapper is exact on U; its zero extension elsewhere is not used.",
    "fixed_base": "Select inverse value base/loss and the reviewed159 forward base/loss before all n. Enlarge just their single common operatorBase via max. Apply selected349 exactly once to the zero-travel family; its output is exists base, forall n, exists loss, forall R>=1,s, exists C.",
    "all_travel": "Postcompose the resulting same inverse jets with the genuine translation by -travel. Actual positive inverse equality on U and HasProjectiveJetsOn.unique identify every given JP. Grading contraction has constant1 at every s, so the already chosen C precedes all travel and JP choices.",
    "weight": "The original CircleModel T gamma and sample weights remain unchanged throughout. gamma=3/4 is a later direct specialization; no material factor is dropped or replaced."
